@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### Health
GET {{base}}/api/v1/health

### Saved index statistics
GET {{base}}/api/v1/index

### Grouped phrase search over published guides
GET {{base}}/api/v1/search?q=%28java%20OR%20kotlin%29%20%22search%20engine%22%20-draft%20path%3Aguides%2F

### Prefix search restricted to text files
GET {{base}}/api/v1/search?q=jav*%20type%3Atxt

### Second result, with the full total retained
GET {{base}}/api/v1/search?q=java&offset=1&limit=1

### Indexed term suggestions
GET {{base}}/api/v1/suggest?q=jav&limit=10

### Expected HTTP 400
GET {{base}}/api/v1/search?q=java&limit=0
